Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.84,0:00:51.11,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,You strange, monstrous creatures!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.11,0:00:59.19,Serifa Std,,0,0,1,,{\fs22.5}I shall let you taste to the fullest the practical combat alchemy passed down through the Armstrong family!
